name an open order is an entry of Your Portfolio, under its holding, and can be cancelled there
show-buy Oil
click FinanceOverhaulOrderTabLimit
type FinanceOverhaulShareAmountField 3
type FinanceOverhaulLimitPriceField 1
click Button
expect-orders-delta 1
show-economy
wait 1
scroll-into-view FinanceOverhaulOpenOrderRow-$order
expect-in-view FinanceOverhaulOpenOrderRow-$order OwnedInvestmentsPanel
expect-prev-has FinanceOverhaulOpenOrderRow-$order Oil Industry
expect-text FinanceOverhaulOpenOrderText-$order Oil Industry
expect-text FinanceOverhaulOpenOrderDetail-$order 3 shares at or below ₡1 · 60 days left
expect-no-overflow FinanceOverhaulOpenOrderRow-$order
capture portfolio-orders
# Vanilla re-sorts the list periodically; the card must stay under its holding.
wait 3
expect-prev-has FinanceOverhaulOpenOrderRow-$order Oil Industry
click FinanceOverhaulOpenOrderCancel-$order
wait 1
expect-orders-delta 0
expect-hidden FinanceOverhaulOpenOrderRow-$order
cleanup:
cancel-new-orders
close-dialog
